 "status": "ok",
 "verdict": "For every family and load mode the generator claims (mooncake, fast25_conversation, fast25_synthetic, synthetic_sessions x open_speedup, closed_concurrency), the AIPerf workload is semantically identical to replay's: request set and order, bit-identical open-loop arrivals, exact ISL and OSL targets, identical prefix-sharing structure, identical session membership and think delays, the same closed-loop C-slot admission rule, and the same warm-up/window scoring. The only non-equivalences are AgentX (no live path) and live-only client residuals measured at milliseconds, which moved windowed goodput by at most 0.06% when a stub replayed replay's own latencies.",
