  {
   "id": "NE1-agentx",
   "what": "AgentX (agentic_lanes, Agentic Mooncake v2 lowered traces) has no live load-generator path; gen_aiperf_inputs refuses it (confirmed on agentx-V1-base-n4-lanes-L2).",
   "why": "Replay's lanes need typed dispatch/completion edges with per-edge delays, join and replay_barrier relations, play-relative not_before_ms floors and lanes dealt ordinal % L that recycle on play quiescence; upstream AIPerf agentic_replay/dag_jsonl and the prior finite fork do not implement them.",
   "impact": "Coverage gap, not a measurement error: the AgentX family (8 train, 4 val, 14 test cells; the family where the pilot's M1 trailed) cannot be validated live, so the A13 sim-vs-live check speaks only for mooncake, fast25 (conversation, synthetic) and synthetic_sessions.",
   "severity": "major (scope)",
   "mitigation": "a dedicated driver that executes the lowered graph with replay's lane rules, or fork work on lane recycling and replay_barrier; not attempted"
